ation: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;div style="overflow: hidden;"&gt;&lt;div style="float: right; margin-left: 12px;"&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;table width="203"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ifNvaGhKnaEM/v1/-1x-1.png" alt="Image associated with story &amp;quot;Los Angeles, Hawaii Beaches Brace for Dangerous Tropical Weather&amp;quot;" width="203" height="136"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="与故事“洛杉矶、夏威夷海滩准备迎接危险的热带天气”相关的图片" height="88" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ifNvaGhKnaEM/v1/-1x-1.png" width="131" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: normal; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 18px !important;"&gt;洛杉矶和夏威夷海滩准备迎接危险的热带天气&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4; margin: 0; margin-top: 8px; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;热带风暴系统将在劳动节周末期间对西海岸海滩造成严重破坏，增加洛杉矶地区危险洋流的威胁，以及受灾严重的夏威夷出现新一轮飓风的威胁。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;本周零听&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #f5f5f5; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/90moV55dDEsNYqULY3T1byorR9tBIpiVZLSyfc4f3mbQHgPVx0wKjT33kGObYIHOhacJ-70jnsHwrwpol3_DEpKOaBgf5SA-38mfqBbBgf5AjvUrp6GVt4cW3zS2qDeqq1KbXM1STFL21RDViuhQSV8FrVp0LfOKm4UJ8Gsunpgd4u2QQMT8DpZ64jk4YGlaxo-ahsSH2x5bmdYIyhY-lSPw5oS6fui1dLwPqDNaup7GLBssdEo7pQBy8JFatSi5PTD0FKak97OlCTfgM5CuSvJEH3IHc7hU-v09gxBZSeWfJ7Z6iKoIO4PM5XsjitWjH9HvLKTAo4lzqh8a-vpKyfYb18YoqJ2PCe-fhP040B7lz6uQG_QbIfILruap-4IywEbqhoSTXWWX3_ixB-r3kcIHSHkatgWvPIQESHauSNqvZPRUsqPdzjatLU7F0LBMvSf6kSCcmwNbJea06jG0nCR-yfwCCEfJcMvVivu7v7QHXfODpNwRJHlQ41Jt4qQdX-3r3IZs0R48EQLxaRglVF5kdKpUJdwe8SFDbnzrUTPCpbs/I-s-kqnLE77q